 Dichotomy of Feature Learning and Unlearning: Fast-Slow Analysis on Neural Networks with Stochastic Gradient Descent&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://arxiv.org/abs/2602.06320&#34;&gt;[2602.06320] High-Dimensional Limit of Stochastic Gradient Flow via Dynamical Mean-Field Theory&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://arxiv.org/abs/2602.07378&#34;&gt;[2602.07378] Dichotomy of Feature Learning and Unlearning: Fast-Slow Analysis on Neural Networks with Stochastic Gradient Descent&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://sotanishy.github.io/&#34;&gt;https://sotanishy.github.io/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;動的平均場理論を理解しておきたい．&lt;/p&gt;</description>
